  {
   "type": "generic_update",
   "title": "Bug Fixes",
   "role": null,
   "description": null,
   "heroes": [],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "title": "General",
     "body": "- Fixed an issue with missing textures on the Charming: 76 skin.\n- Fixed some minor issues with Jetpack Cat and the tether animation for various heroes.\n- Fixed an issue that hid Jetpack Cat’s aim‑assist strength and threshold settings.\n- Fixed an issue with Vendetta’s sword‑throw animation in third person.\n- Fixed an issue where Mizuki could still perform Katashiro Return while stunned.\n- Fixed an issue where Mercy's passive displayed incorrectly in the Advanced Info Panel.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Stadium",
     "body": "- Fixed an issue causing the Stadium UI to disappear after a round transition.\n- Fixed an issue where Vendetta could spam her ultimate power without a full charge.\n- Fixed an issue where Vendetta would not receive ultimate charge while using the “Overloaded” strike power.\n- Fixed an issue where Vendetta's Primary Fire would not trigger Gloomgauntlet or be increased by Melee Damage.\n- Fixed an issue where the VFX for Bola Shot when using Freja’s “So Cooked” power were incorrect.\n- Fixed an issue with Ana’s “Dreamy” power that incorrectly canceled the benefits of Artsy Daisy and Tactical Rifle.\n- Fixed an issue where Mercy's Self Healing from healing allies with missing health was incorrectly reduced to 15% instead of the intended 40%.",
     "dev": null
    }
   ]
  }
